{{#> base}}
    <h2>Thank You for Contacting IFCA</h2>
    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
    
    <p>Thank you for reaching out to the Indian Federation of Culinary Associations (IFCA). We have received your message and will respond to your inquiry shortly.</p>
    
    <div class="alert alert-info">
        <h3>Message Details</h3>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> {{subject}}<br>
        <strong>Date:</strong> {{submissionDate}}<br>
        <strong>Reference ID:</strong> {{referenceId}}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="metadata">
        <p><strong>Response Timeline:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li>Our team will review your message within 24-48 hours</li>
            <li>We will respond to your inquiry as soon as possible</li>
            <li>For urgent matters, please call us directly</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p>For immediate assistance, please contact us at:</p>
    <p>Email: contact.pvlifcaindia@gmail.com<br>
    Phone: +91 00000 00000<br>
    Address: Q Block, 14 (New Number 22), Plot No 3731, 3rd Main Road, Anna Nagar, Chennai – 600040</p>

    <p>Best regards,<br>
    The IFCA Support Team</p>
{{/base}} 